OL,3,GNEWSAFlats plan for derelict site looks
OL,4,Aset to be approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan for an apartment block looks set
OL,7,Fto be approved despite concerns raised
OL,8,Fby a local councillor about other
OL,9,Fprojects linked to the developer.
OL,11,FDeveloper SGL4 Ltd wants to build up to
OL,12,F30 apartments on an old storage yard on
OL,13,FRichmond Row in Everton, Liverpool.
OL,15,FA local councillor has objected to the
OL,16,Fplan, saying the firm was linked to
OL,17,Fothers behind "sites that are either
OL,18,Fnot yet developed out, have major
OL,19,Fproblems with building standards and
OL,20,Fplanning conditions".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
